<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2182_8187.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser freundtlich willig dienst zuvor, fürsichtige
<lb n="2"/>ersame und weise, besonders liebe <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guete</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freünd</unclear>
<lb n="3"/>und nachbarn.
<lb n="4"/>E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. haben sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zweifels</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ohne</unclear> noch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">massen</unclear>
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zueerinnern</unclear>, was sie sub dato. <date resp="#ner">17. decembris</date> jüngst
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abgewichenen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jahrs</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ihres</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">burgers</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Jacoben Mül-
<lb n="7"/>lers</persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">genandt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Negers</unclear>, der bij weilund unserer
<lb n="8"/>burgerin <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">RichaHueberin</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verlaßenschafft</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anmaße</unclear>-
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nender</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbschafft</unclear> halber, an unß gelangen
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wessen</unclear> wir sie <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßwegen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">widerbeantwurtet</unclear>,
<lb n="11"/>Demnach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aber</unclear> uff heüt dato deß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemelter</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Richa</unclear>
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hueberin</unclear></persName> seeligen schwöstermann <persName resp="#ner">Sebastian
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wagner</unclear></persName> burger zu <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-112" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Straßburg</placeName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bij</unclear> unß angelangt,
<lb n="14"/>und neben oberkeitlicher bescheinung seines recht-
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">meßigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">antritts</unclear> diser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hereditet</unclear>, auch von
<lb n="16"/>der statt Straßburg <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gebürende</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">caution</unclear> mit ge-
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pracht</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inmaßen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. auß dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bejschluß</unclear> mit
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mehrerm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuesehen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> haben wir nit umb-
<lb n="19"/>gehen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">könden</unclear>, sie dessen zue <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ire</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burger</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachrich</unclear>-
<lb n="20"/>tung wider <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zueberichten</unclear>. Und weil <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiedurch</unclear>
<lb n="21"/>bescheint würdt, das der abgestorbnen <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Richa</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hueberin</unclear></persName> leibliche schwöster, noch im leben,
<lb n="23"/>welche einig und allein diser erbschafft
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vähig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> sein vermeint. So sollen wir dem
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sovil</unclear> alß andern mehr, die sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ebenmäßig</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2182_8188.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="26"/>deßwegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bei</unclear> unß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ungemelt</unclear> zu <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deren</unclear> belieben
<lb n="27"/>sein, ob sie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> ihre <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eigne</unclear> gefahr und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">costen</unclear>,
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nechstanstenden</unclear> <date resp="#ner">Monntag den 24. diß</date>, deß-
<lb n="29"/>wegen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angesetzten</unclear> tag, sich hieher <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verfuegen</unclear>,
<lb n="30"/>oder aber bei solcher erfahrung <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rhuw</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gesuechten</unclear>
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zueteil</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Nem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dister</unclear> Erbschaft <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lobsen</unclear> wollen, E.
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. freund. und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachborlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ersuechende</unclear>, die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woellen</unclear>
<lb n="33"/>solchen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angesetzten</unclear> tag der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zeiger</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuwißen</unclear> machen,
<lb n="34"/>dann sie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erscheine</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">oder</unclear> nit, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">würdet</unclear> nichts <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">desto</unclear>-
<lb n="35"/>weniger <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> der sachen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fortgefahren</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">menig</unclear>-
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">clichen</unclear> die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gebuer</unclear> erfolgt werden, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolten</unclear>
<lb n="37"/>E. W. denen wir zu angenemen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachborlichen</unclear>
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">diensten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ieder</unclear> zeit bereitwillig verbleiben,
<lb n="39"/>nit verhalten, unß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sametlichen</unclear> hiemit
<lb n="40"/>Gottes gnaden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befelhende</unclear>. Datum <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ex</unclear> <origDate when="1620" resp="#ner">19. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">X</unclear>
<lb n="41"/>Jenner Anno 1620</origDate>.
<lb n="42"/><orgName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermaister und Rath
<lb n="43"/>der Statt Lindaw</orgName>.
