<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2182_8190.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="44"/>Den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuersichtigen</unclear> ersamen und weisen <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burger=
<lb n="45"/>meister und Rhat der Statt St. Gallen</orgName>, unsern
<lb n="46"/>besondern lieben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gueten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freuenden</unclear> und nachbarn.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2182_8191.jpg" n="5"/>
<lb n="47"/>Unser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freündtlich</unclear> dienst zuvor <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eersambe</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Weyse</unclear>,
<lb n="48"/>Liebe und guete Freündt.
<lb n="49"/>Daß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ihr</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abliben</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weÿlandt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüers</unclear>
<lb n="50"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">burgers</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Hannß Huobers</persName> dochter <persName resp="#ner">Prisca</persName> seelig,
<lb n="51"/>unsers burger <persName resp="#ner">Sebastian <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Metzgers</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verheürathet</unclear>,
<lb n="52"/>zum besten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuschriben</unclear>, under <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dato</unclear> deß <date resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">14</unclear>.</date> nechst
<lb n="53"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwichnen</unclear> monats <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">9bris</unclear> zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wissen</unclear> gemacht.
<lb n="54"/>Und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nebet</unclear> überschickhung inventarij unnd
<lb n="55"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermachens</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">brieffs</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeith</unclear>, monats ihme
<lb n="56"/>bestimbt, dessen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuen</unclear> wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> freündtlich
<lb n="57"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bedankhen</unclear>, habend <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwagts</unclear>, nicht un-
<lb n="58"/>derlassen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gedachtem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unserm</unclear> burger,
<lb n="59"/>zuo seiner wahren nachrichtung, daß schri-
<lb n="60"/>ben, sambt den beÿlagen zuüberraichen.
<lb n="61"/>Der hat sich nun <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seines</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">brichts</unclear> übergeben,
<lb n="62"/>unnd unß zum <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vleißigisten</unclear> umb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">buergschafft</unclear>
<lb n="63"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersuecht</unclear>, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gebüehrliche</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weise</unclear> gebetten,
<lb n="64"/>wie die beilag mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mehrerem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuerkennen</unclear>
<lb n="65"/>gibt. Wann es dann <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mit</unclear>
<lb n="66"/>seiner <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">haußfrawen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schwöster</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Anna</persName>
<lb n="67"/>abscheiden, im <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bricht</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angefuehrter</unclear>
<lb n="68"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">massen</unclear> bewandt, daß sie alß ein ledige
<lb n="69"/>persohn, in ieren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allmuosen</unclear>: oder <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seel</unclear>-
<lb n="70"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gietter</unclear> hauß allhie verstorben unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sunsten</unclear>
<lb n="71"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khain</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schwösteren</unclear>, vil weniger derselben
<lb n="72"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kinder</unclear> vorhanden sein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sollen</unclear>, und gedacht
<lb n="73"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> burger unß wegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebettner</unclear>
<lb n="74"/>caution
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2182_8192.jpg" n="6"/>
<lb n="75"/>caution so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ine</unclear> leisten sollen, gnuog-
<lb n="76"/>samb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">versichret</unclear>. So <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbiotten</unclear> wir unß dahin
<lb n="77"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">das</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">auf</unclear> alle fahl <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euch</unclear> als <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obrigkheit</unclear>
<lb n="78"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dißorts</unclear> an statt unnsers burgers, gegen
<lb n="79"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">maeniglich</unclear> so dise verlaßenschafft kuenfftig
<lb n="80"/>anzuesprechen vermeint, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vertretten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schadloß</unclear> halten, und all-
